{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Clicker Kingdom</i>, a realm where every click shapes your empire\u2019s destiny. Begin as a modest ruler, gathering resources manually, but soon unlock tools, upgrades, and allies that will automate production and growth. Expand your lands, build grand structures, and enhance your economy as you progress. With each upgrade, your kingdom\u2019s potential soars, introducing new opportunities and challenges. The goal is simple: create the most prosperous kingdom and watch it flourish! Whether you're actively clicking or letting your kingdom grow on its own, <i>Clicker Kingdom</i> offers an engaging mix of strategy, growth, and resource management. Ready to lead your realm to greatness?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gold (Level 1)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298880/33f71b47361cc1463d4d472272d1157b5d234c62.jpg"},{"name":"Gold (Level 2)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298880/33f71b47361cc1463d4d472272d1157b5d234c62.jpg"},{"name":"Gold (Level 3)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298880/33f71b47361cc1463d4d472272d1157b5d234c62.jpg"},{"name":"Gold (Level 4)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298880/33f71b47361cc1463d4d472272d1157b5d234c62.jpg"},{"name":"Gold (Level 5)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298880/33f71b47361cc1463d4d472272d1157b5d234c62.jpg"},{"name":"Gold (Level 6)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298880/33f71b47361cc1463d4d472272d1157b5d234c62.jpg"},{"name":"Gold (Level 7)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298880/33f71b47361cc1463d4d472272d1157b5d234c62.jpg"},{"name":"Gold (Level 8)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298880/33f